# Deferred debug-viewer work

- `trace/TraceTable.tsx`: group consecutive `sync.update` rows without breaking
  the one-row-per-durable-receipt relationship.
- Going offline during the first lazy load of `DebugOverlay.tsx` (mounted in
  `routes/_authenticated.tsx`) leaves a dynamic-import error until a reload: a
  failed `import()` is cached as failed. Retry the import when the browser
  comes back online, or catch it and render nothing. Seen in the run-state
  browser check (p12353).
